---
---

<section class="mf-price" id="price" aria-labelledby="mf-price-title">
  <!-- Background geometric image (flush left, absolute) -->
  <div class="mf-price__bg" aria-hidden="true">
    <img
      src="/mock_site/MELIAFITNESS/images/price-bg.webp"
      alt=""
      loading="lazy"
    />
  </div>

  <!-- Content (centered over full width) -->
  <div class="mf-price__inner mf-reveal">
    <div class="mf-price__title mf-section-title mf-section-title--center" id="mf-price-title">
      <p class="mf-section-title__en">PRICE</p>
      <p class="mf-section-title__jp">ご利用料金</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mf-price__amount-row">
      <p class="mf-price__monthly">月額</p>
      <div class="mf-price__amount">
        <span class="mf-price__yen">¥</span>
        <span class="mf-price__num">29,800</span>
        <span class="mf-price__tax">税込</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="mf-price__description">週1で通うMELIA FITNESSのパーソナルトレーニング</p>
    <p class="mf-price__body">トレーナーとマンツーマンで理想的なボディメイクを目指します。</p>
    <p class="mf-price__note">※Kailaniご指名の場合は月額￥39,800</p>
  </div>
</section>
